<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-AHONEN WINS NORMAL HILL SKI JUMPING GOLD.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-AHONEN WINS NORMAL HILL SKI JUMPING GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finn Janne Ahonen won</p>
<p>gold in the normal hill ski jumping at the Nordic skiing world</p>
<p>championships on Saturday with 263.5 points, according to</p>
<p>provisional results.</p>
<p>Japanese Masahiko Harada took silver with 258.5 points and</p>
<p>Andreas Goldberger of Austria took bronze with 257 points.</p>
</text>
